# Important Realization

Hashes are basically Ruby’s version of:

* JavaScript objects
* JSON
* dictionaries in Python

So this knowledge transfers directly across languages. ***

Ruby:

```ruby id="qbdv9q"
{name: "Ashoor"}
```

JavaScript:

```javascript id="6r4w9u"
{name: "Ashoor"}
```

Python:

```python id="3gx5cv"
{"name": "Ashoor"}
```

Very similar concept.  Concept - means an idea, principle, or way something works; understanding behind something- not just memorizing syntax or steps.

