# One Small Correction

This:

```ruby id="74j6ul"
p laptops[1]
```

prints the ENTIRE second hash.

If you specifically wanted only the model:

```ruby id="6up5su"
p laptops[1][:model]
```

That’s a very important distinction:

* array access first
* then hash key access

